title: "02 Geo3D Analyzer"
version: "1.2.2"
date-released: "2026-10-26"
url: "https://github.com/YusufEminoglu/zero2geospatial3d"
license: "MIT"
abstract: "3D viewer and analyzer for terrain and buildings: ENVI-met style microclimate (UTCI, PET, surface temperature, canopy cooling), street-canyon ventilation and pollutant dispersion, 3D acoustics, Green View Index, solar envelope, sun and shadow, sky view and facade daylight (VSC), solar PV, visibility, terrain analyses, BRE 209 planning checks and NSGA-II height optimisation, with every result returned to QGIS."
